  "body": "Snapshot the iteration length for the array-methods plugin's `find` and `findLast`, matching native array searches.\n\nOnce a draft has a copy, a predicate can append or remove entries through the draft. The current loop then searches newly appended values or stops early when the array shrinks.\n\nThree regressions fail with the plugin enabled and pass in the native-mode controls. All 3,377 base tests and the package build pass, including type declarations.\n",
